          "children": [
            {
              "id": "108:383",
              "name": "Dear reader,",
              "w": 620,
              "h": 55,
              "text": "Dear reader,",
              "font": {
                "family": "Instrument Serif",
                "style": "Italic"
              },
              "size": 38,
              "link": null
            },
            {
              "id": "108:384",
              "name": "[What brought you here? Describe the event, your role, and the idea or question you explored in a short personal note.]",
              "w": 620,
              "h": 125,
              "text": "I spent a week at Stanford University with my P20 IES Pathways research group through the UTSA–Stanford University Pathways Summer Institute. Research sessions, faculty talks, graduate student panels, and class visits gave me a closer look at educational research and what pursuing a Ph.D. can look like.",
              "font": {
                "family": "Inter",
                "style": "Regular",
                "variationSettings": {
                  "wght": 400,
                  "slnt": 0
                }
              },
              "size": 17,
              "link": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "108:386",
          "name": "Highlights",
          "w": 380,
          "h": 354,
          "layout": "VERTICAL",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "108:387",
              "name": "The moments I’m keeping",
              "w": 380,
              "h": 55,
              "text": "The moments I’m keeping",
              "font": {
                "family": "Instrument Serif",
                "style": "Regular"
              },
              "size": 38,
              "link": null
            },
            {
              "id": "108:388",
              "name": "[One thing you made or contributed] [One thing you learned] [A person, conversation, or moment that stayed with you]",
              "w": 380,
              "h": 275,
              "text": "Visited EDUC 218: Topics in Cognition and Learning with Dr. Bruce McCandliss, exploring how AI can enhance human cognition.\n\nJoined the Journeys to and through Graduate School panel and conversations with graduate students.\n\nExplored campus and San Francisco, tried new food, and made memories with fellow students.",
              "font": {
                "family": "Inter",
                "style": "Regular",
                "variationSettings": {
                  "wght": 400,
                  "slnt": 0
                }
              },
              "size": 17,
